        <mxCell id="if-e_54" parent="1" style="shape=note;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=6;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;" value="&lt;b&gt;QoS 이름&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;STATE: best_effort · volatile · depth 5 (주기 상태, 최신 값만)&lt;br&gt;LATCHED: reliable · transient_local · depth 1 (지금 값, 바뀔 때와 주기적으로)&lt;br&gt;EVENT: reliable · volatile · depth 50 (기록용 사건)&lt;br&gt;HEARTBEAT: reliable · volatile · depth 1 (0.5초 주기, 1.5초 끊기면 로봇이 멈춤)" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="640" y="1146" width="600" height="96" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
